	"Name": "Athanaeri Corner",
	"Author": "nraittanna",
	"Description": "[color=#a64d79][size=6][b]Athanaeri Corner[/b][/size][/color]\n<br />[size=3]Athanaeri Corner was first created to house my other mod Life Cycle's pairings after they moved in together. I completely redesigned it since it was causing problems and have decided to publish it separately to allow other modders to use it for their own NPCs.\n<br />[/size][b]\n<br />[size=5]Installation:[/size][/b]\n<br />[list=1]\n<br />[*][size=3][b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2400][b]SMAPI[/b][/url]\uFEFF[/b],[b] [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915][b]Content Patcher[/b][/url]\uFEFF[/b] and[b] [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1820]TMXL[/url]\uFEFF[/b] must be installed.[/size]\n<br />[*][size=3]Download the mod and unzip it.[/size]\n<br />[*][size=3]Place the folder [b]Athanaeri Corner[/b] into your Mods folder.[/size]\n<br />[/list]\n<br />[b][size=5]For modders:\n<br />[/size][/b][size=3]If you want to move one of you NPCs to Athanaeri Corner, you can simply edit the .tmx house files located in\u00A0Athanaeri Corner&#92;[TMX] Athanaeri Corner&#92;assets.[/size]\n<br />[size=3]I recommend not modifying the entrance door, since that would require changing the warps. If you need help, don't hesitate to send me a message! :)[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=5][b]Compatibility:[/b][/size][list]\n<br />[*]Stardew Valley Expanded: compatible.\n<br />[*]Boarding House: compatible.\n<br />[*]Ridgeside Village: compatible (download RSV version).\n<br />[*]The Stray Catfe: compatible.\n<br />[/list]",
